  {
    "id": "fn.textjoin-at-limit",
    "description": "LEN(TEXTJOIN(\"\", TRUE, REPT(\"a\", 32767))) is 32767 (exactly the UTF-16 cap for ASCII). Microsoft says 32767 characters; that is the cell-width cap, not Compat-v2 LEN scalars.",
